# RASTATIME 2026-05-25 — Seamless-Bus-Mix Phase B (skeleton).
#
# This script is the long-running Liquidsoap subprocess that replaces
# mpv + 3x FfmpegStreamer + the PHP-side crossfade calculations.
# It is driven by the Python LiquidsoapPlayoutEngine over telnet
# (see backend/playout/libretime_playout/engine/liquidsoap_telnet.py).
#
# Phase B (this skeleton): structural outline only.  Placeholders for
# Icecast credentials and source-switch logic — nothing connects yet.
#
# Phase C will fill in:
#   * Telnet-server enable (so the Python engine can push commands)
#   * request.queue source for scheduled tracks
#   * input.harbor for Master / Show DJ
#   * switch(...) to combine sources
#   * 3x output.icecast (mp3 / aac / ogg)
#   * Crossfade + ReplayGain handling
#
# Phase D will:
#   * Add real per-station credentials via env-var substitution
#   * Wire local-monitoring output
#   * Add prometheus metrics (Liquidsoap has builtin support)
# =====================================================================

